+# Task 3: Inline Tier-2 Packages
+
+## Scope
+Inline **6 tier-2 core packages** that depend on already-inlined packages:
+
+1. `rules-engine` (~3.1k LOC, 44 files) ÔÇö depends on utils
+2. `comment-checker-core` (~498 LOC, 5 files) ÔÇö depends on utils
+3. `telemetry-core` (~977 LOC, 12 files) ÔÇö depends on utils
+4. `delegate-core` (~400 LOC, 6 files) ÔÇö depends on model-core
+5. `prompts-core` (~653 LOC, 14 files) ÔÇö depends on model-core, utils
+6. `agents-md-core` (~278 LOC, 9 files) ÔÇö depends on rules-engine
+
+## Steps
+
+### Step 1: Copy source trees + fix internal imports
+For each package, copy `packages/{name}/src/*` to `src/shared/{name}/`, then fix `@oh-my-opencode/` ÔåÆ `#shared/` within all `src/shared/{name}/` files.
+
+Use a script or function to avoid repetition:
+```pwsh
+$tier2 = @('rules-engine','comment-checker-core','telemetry-core','delegate-core','prompts-core','agents-md-core')
+foreach ($pkg in $tier2) {
+    Copy-Item -Recurse "packages/$pkg/src/*" "src/shared/$pkg/"
+}
+```
+
+Then within `src/shared/*/`, bulk-replace `@oh-my-opencode/` with `#shared/`.
+
+### Step 2: Fix omo-opencode imports
+In `packages/omo-opencode/src/`, bulk-replace each old workspace package reference:
+- `@oh-my-opencode/rules-engine` ÔåÆ `#shared/rules-engine` (~19 files)
+- `@oh-my-opencode/comment-checker-core` ÔåÆ `#shared/comment-checker-core` (~3 files)
+- `@oh-my-opencode/telemetry-core` ÔåÆ `#shared/telemetry-core` (~6 files)
+- `@oh-my-opencode/delegate-core` ÔåÆ `#shared/delegate-core` (~4 files)
+- `@oh-my-opencode/prompts-core` ÔåÆ `#shared/prompts-core` (~9 files)
+- `@oh-my-opencode/agents-md-core` ÔåÆ `#shared/agents-md-core` (~3 files)
+
+### Step 3: Verify
+```bash
+tsgo --noEmit
+```
+Must be zero errors on `src/shared/**/*`. Vendored MCP builds should still work.
+
+### Step 4: Commit
+```bash
+git add -A && git commit -m "phase2(task3): inline tier-2 packages"
+```
+
+## Global Constraints
+- `#shared/{name}` ÔåÆ `src/shared/{name}/index.ts` path alias already in tsconfig
+- Restore original `package.json` for each inlined package (revert the re-export shim from Task 1)
+- Vendored MCPs don't reference these packages, so no vendored dep updates needed
+- Each `src/shared/{name}/` needs a minimal `package.json` (`{ "type": "module", "name": "@oh-my-opencode/{name}", "main": "index.ts" }`) for `file:` dep compatibility
+- Keep original source at `packages/{name}/src/` for now (don't delete ÔÇö will be removed in Task 5)
