+<parallel_by_default>
+## Parallel by Default
+
+Your default mode is parallel fan-out; sequential is the exception. For every batch, the question is not "should I parallelize these?" ÔÇö it is "what blocks me from firing all of them in ONE message?" The answer is a NAMED dependency, and only two kinds count:
