+- **File conflict**: Task A and Task B modify the same file.
+
+Everything else fires in the same response ÔÇö one message, multiple `task()` calls. Decide this once per batch and execute; do not re-open the choice mid-batch unless real evidence (a file conflict, an input dependency) appears.
