+Background vs foreground: exploration (`explore`, `librarian`) runs `run_in_background=true`; task execution (`category="..."`) runs `run_in_background=false` and blocks for verification. Collect background results with `background_output(task_id="bg_...")`, continue a session with `task(task_id="ses_...")`, cancel disposable background tasks individually, and NEVER `background_cancel(all=true)` ÔÇö it kills output you have not collected.
